    {
      "id": "M4152-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A: 虚构注意力计算，两个头均从相同输入序列产生各自的Q/K/V。给定归一化权重A1=[[3/4,1/4],[1/2,1/2]],V1=[[2],[6]]；A2=[[1/4,3/4],[1,0]],V2=[[8],[-4]]。各头Hi=AiVi，按每个token的特征轴拼接[H1,H2]，再乘WO=[[1],[2]]。请算两个头、拼接及输出，与先均值合并两个头作对照；不要替作者改定义。核对“多头就是多个传感器或多个故障类；头输出相加/均值与拼接恒等；softmax行归一化使最终输出也是概率；每头已证明独立物理关联；多头一概比单头有效”的说法。说明同来源输入的不同Q/K/V投影是否仍为self-attention；如果Q来自另一种输入而K/V仍来自原输入，头数不变时应核对什么。查现有词库对完整multi-head attention / multi-head self-attention的双论文定义与独立中文对应记录是否完成；普通attention/self-attention已完成也不能冒充限定全名的完成记录。未完成不等于词无效；保留作者批准新名及准确常规描述，不强求每个新方法已有同名先例。给不超过40词正向英文方法句，包含拼接后投影如何构成输出；算术/命名限制放作者说明。\n",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Preserve both projected head outputs, token-wise concatenation, learned output projection and the distinct mean/sum alternatives.",
        "Distinguish coefficients, feature outputs, head count, self/cross input sources, physical interpretation and actual complete-name/Chinese record."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Silently substitute averaging for concatenation or infer task probabilities/physical independence from normalized coefficients.",
        "Treat head count as sensors/classes, claim universal superiority, or inherit full qualified-name admission from ordinary attention."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves both head outputs, token-wise feature concatenation and projected output, differentiates the mean/sum alternatives, and reports the scoped multihead definition/Chinese evidence without inheriting physical or full-variant guarantees.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
